// Module github.com/libraz/go-oidc-provider/examples/24-byo-userstore
// demonstrates how to plug an existing embedder-owned users table
// into the OP through a hand-rolled store.UserPasswordStore plus a
// thin embedding wrapper that overrides Users(). It is its own
// sub-module so the SQL driver dependency stays out of the main
// module's go.sum.
